WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Fuel pressure regulator
What it does: Regulates fuel pressure relative to intake pressure using its diaphragm mechanism.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Fuel pressure regulator
How it works: Intake reference pressure and the spring oppose it.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Fuel pressure regulator
How it moves: The body stays fixed; the diaphragm and internal valve modulate return flow.
